<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Entangle</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Druid (guild level 21), Ranger (guild level 35, up to 70%)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast entangle &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster raises both hands slowly and points, and thick, writhing vines 
shoot from the ground and wrap the target. Held in the vines, they can do 
little but look about, talk and check themselves; a player can't walk away, 
and can cast no spell but dispel magic. The vines also shield them: nobody 
can attack them while they are bound. The vines hold for about half a 
minute, a little longer the better your spell, and a strong enough dispel 
magic tears them away.
</p><p>The target resists with their mind. The vines won't take hold of anyone 
above level 50, and they can't grow indoors or out on the water. It can be 
cast while fighting. It is also found on potions, wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
